---
import '../styles/conversations.css';
---
<section id="conversations"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2><span class="en">BHW Conversations</span><span class="hu">BHW beszélgetések</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="/conversations/"><span class="en">Explore the series →</span><span class="hu">A sorozat →</span></a></div>
  <p class="conversation-intro"><span class="en">Meet the people behind the hardware. Ideas, detours and what it takes to make them work.</span><span class="hu">Ismerd meg a hardver mögött álló embereket: ötletek, kitérők és a megvalósítás kihívásai.</span></p>
  <article class="conversation-feature">
    <div class="conversation-cover" data-conversation-player>
      <a href="/conversations/steven-antalics/"><img src="/images/conversations/steven-and-andrii-prague-bright.jpg" width="1920" height="1080" alt="EkoHaul founder Steven Antalics smiling during his conversation with Andrii Shylenko in Prague" loading="lazy" /></a>
      <button type="button" class="conversation-play" data-play-conversation aria-label="Play the full Steven Antalics interview"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span><span class="en">Play interview · 20:37</span><span class="hu">Lejátszás · 20:37</span></button>
    </div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="en">Episode 01 · Steven Antalics · EkoHaul</span><span class="hu">01. epizód · Steven Antalics · EkoHaul</span></p>
      <h3><a href="/conversations/steven-antalics/"><span class="en">A sunny roof and a twenty-year-old idea</span><span class="hu">Egy napsütötte tető és egy húszéves ötlet</span></a></h3>
      <p><span class="en">His dad drove trucks. He built a solar race car. Twenty years later, Steven is putting those two worlds together—and looking for a pilot partner.</span><span class="hu">Édesapja kamiont vezetett, ő napelemes versenyautót épített. Húsz évvel később Steven összeköti a két világot, és pilotpartnert keres.</span></p>
      <div class="conversation-actions"><a class="text-link" href="/conversations/steven-antalics/"><span class="en">Read the article →</span><span class="hu">A cikk elolvasása →</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://youtu.be/1BYTsZtyBic"><span class="en">Watch on YouTube ↗</span><span class="hu">Megtekintés a YouTube-on ↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div></section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-play-conversation]').forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const player = button.closest('[data-conversation-player]');
      if (!player) return;
      const iframe = document.createElement('iframe');
      iframe.src = 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1BYTsZtyBic?autoplay=1&playsinline=1';
      iframe.title = 'Steven Antalics full interview · Budapest Hardware Club';
      iframe.allow = 'autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share';
      iframe.allowFullscreen = true;
      iframe.referrerPolicy = 'strict-origin-when-cross-origin';
      player.replaceChildren(iframe);
      iframe.focus();
    }, { once: true });
  });
</script>
